    "content": "Title: Standard Procedure for Account Access Reset\n\nAs an IT team, we have standardized procedures to maintain system security and user account integrity. One such procedure is resetting access when locked due to forgotten passwords.\n\n**Step 1: Verification** - Begin by verifying your identity through our authentication process, accessible via the login page.\n\n**Step 2: Request Reset** - Once verified, proceed to submit a password reset request from the same page. Ensure all requested information is accurate for successful processing.\n\n**Note:** If you encounter any issues during these steps or have further questions, please reach out to our IT support team.",
